  "summary": "Rustic is a broad design modifier and aesthetic based around rustic themes, or farms, and is generally a romanticized version of rural living.",
  "description": "Rustic is a broad design modifier and aesthetic based around rustic themes, or farms, and is generally a romanticized version of rural living. Generally this aesthetic imitates the style of the American Midwest, although portrayals can vary by region.",
  "culturalContext": "The word “rustic” simply means something related to rural living and the countryside.",
