  "fashion": {
    "Overview": "Rusticcore fashion is made up of practical, work clothes and/or homemade clothing made of simple materials such as wool and cotton. Fall colors, especially browns and reds are key. Rusticcore fashion shares some overlap with Grunge, since a lot of original Grunge fashion was clothing that farmers and people like that wore because the clothing was intended to be long-lasting to be able to handle the wear and tear of the rigors of working on the farm. Common aspects of rustic fashion include:"
